sequenceDiagram
  %% Target design: ADR 0244 task + DECISIONS R1, R2, R4; orbit-agent observes only, Swamp prepares the root.
  %% status: draft
  autonumber
  %% lane CLI icon=terminal pill=caller tone=gray
  %% lane GW icon=gateway pill=intent tone=blue
  %% lane SW icon=workflow pill=executes tone=green
  %% lane N icon=server pill=target tone=amber
  participant CLI as CLI / MCP<br/>orbit · MCP tools
  participant GW as Gateway<br/>Laravel API
  participant SW as Swamp<br/>serve on Node 209
  participant N as Target Node<br/>reached over ssh
  CLI->>GW: node:settings 12<br/>{apps: {path: /srv/apps}}
  Note over GW: Validate patch and root<br/>bridge CIDR, account, Linux
  Note over GW: Record-only? Store, no run<br/>R1 · 200 with the Node
  Note over GW: Record task, not settings<br/>task #5131 · R2
  GW->>SW: Start run, full intent<br/>operation-node-settings
  GW-->>CLI: 202 Accepted<br/>operation #5131
  SW->>N: Look up the Node account<br/>@swamp/ssh · getent passwd orbit
  SW->>N: Prepare the apps root<br/>mkdir, chown, protected roots
  alt root ready
    N-->>SW: owner and mode checked
    SW-->>GW: Run succeeded<br/>terminal event · prepared: true
    Note over GW: Store the settings patch<br/>NodeUpdated broadcast
  else path refused or unowned
    N--xSW: exit ≠ 0
    SW--xGW: Run failed<br/>node.settings_root_failed
    Note over GW: Keep the old settings<br/>task → failed
  end
  loop every 2 s until terminal
    CLI->>GW: operation:show #OP
    GW-->>CLI: status + result
  end
